Compared to the golden standard, the model's response is remarkably close. While the golden standard's problem analysis is slightly more formal and granular, the model's practical output (the improved documentation and examples) is of equivalent quality and utility. It successfully transformed a poor piece of documentation into a comprehensive, best-practice-aligned guide.",26320.764791977126,google,gemini-2.5-pro,True,hybrid,5,5,5,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,True,4096,,,
