content_transformation_001,Landing Page Copy Transformation,0.000014,12.2/40,10.0097,,,⚖️ Judge: 3/5 (Hybrid),0.0,100,claude-3-haiku-20240307,20240307-5bd18c0c,52.22,anthropic,5.22,1271,47.0,60.0/60,success,Tier 1 (Undefined),2026-03-14 10:24:20,26,52.22,3,"The model's response correctly follows the two-part structure requested in the prompt (ANALYSIS then TRANSFORMATION).

**Part 1: ANALYSIS**
The analysis is concise and accurate, adhering to the 2-3 sentence limit. It correctly identifies the input list as feature-focused and not benefit-oriented. It successfully incorporates all the required keywords (""Benefit"", ""Headline"", ""Zielgruppe"", ""Trust"", and implicitly ""CTA"" via ""Handlungsaufforderung""). This part of the task is executed well.

**Part 2: TRANSFORMATION**
