**Part 2: Transformation (Script)**
The model did a good job of incorporating the numerous and specific requirements into the script.

*   **Strengths:**
    *   **Compliance with Cues:** It correctly used all specified cue formats: `[00:00]`, `[PAUSE]`, `[SHOW:]`, `[CLICK:]`, `[CIRCLE:]`, `[ARROW:]`, `[B-ROLL:]`, `[MUSIC:]`, `[TEXT ON SCREEN:]`, and `[JUMP CUT]`.
