reasoning_5c_001,Reasoning 5C: The Scheduling Paradox,0.000530,,3.15,,,⚖️ Judge: 1/5 (Hybrid),0.0,100,claude-3-haiku-20240307,20240307-5bd18c0c,3.0,anthropic,3.0,1119,0.0,,success,Tier 2 (Deep Reasoning),2026-03-14 10:30:32,559,3.0,1,"The model's response is fundamentally flawed and fails to address the core logic of the task. The prompt is a trick question designed to test if the AI can identify an impossible constraint.

