reasoning_5b_001,Reasoning 5B: Root Cause Analysis,0.025780,,24.547,,,⚖️ Judge: 4/5 (Hybrid),0.0,100,claude-opus-4-6,claude-opus-4-6-812e63c4,78.0,anthropic,78.0,4055,0.0,30.0/100,success,Tier 2 (Deep Reasoning),2026-03-14 10:51:22,1168,78.0,4,"The model's response is of very high quality. It correctly identifies the core problem and provides a well-structured, actionable solution.

