reasoning_metacog_001,Metacognition 001: The Sheep Trap (Self-Correction),0.004340,,4.3857,,,⚖️ Judge: 5/5 (Hybrid),0.0,100,claude-opus-4-6,claude-opus-4-6-812e63c4,96.0,anthropic,96.0,467,0.0,,success,Tier 3 (Metacognition),2026-03-14 10:54:09,268,96.0,5,"The user wants me to evaluate an AI's response to a classic riddle against a golden standard.

