- **Task Compliance**: 3.5/5 (covers basic requirements but misses critical bugs)
- **Output Quality**: 3.5/5 (well-formatted but lacks depth and examples)
- **Standard Adherence**: 2.5/5 (significantly fewer issues identified, missing critical bugs, no code examples or roadmap)

