- Medical safety considerations (e.g., dosage ambiguity, medication-specific contraindications)
- Accessibility requirements (WCAG, screen reader compatibility, aria-labels)
- A complete terminology glossary and HEART principles
- Extensive justifications for each change

## Model Response Evaluation

