## Evaluation of Model Response

### Strengths

1. **Problem Identification (Comprehensive)**: The model identified 19 problems across 4 categories, matching the golden standard's scope. Critical issues (C1-C4), High (H1-H5), Medium (M1-M7), and Low (L1-L5) are all present.

