| Justify changes | ✅ Provided | ✅ Provided with more depth | Shorter justifications |
| List problems first | ✅ Done | ✅ Done in matrix format | Format difference |

### Overall Assessment

The model response is **functionally complete** and addresses all major requirements. It identifies the same 19 problems, provides corrected interfaces, creates comprehensive props tables, and includes code examples. However, it falls short of the golden standard in:

