2. The model doesn't explicitly mention `.env.example` file creation/copying until later, whereas golden standard emphasizes this earlier.
3. The model's troubleshooting section is good but slightly less detailed than golden standard (e.g., doesn't explain why `docker-compose` V1 is problematic in as much detail).

### Standard Adherence

