6. **Trust Bar Structure**: The golden standard presents trust signals in a structured footer bar with icons and additional social proof (G2 rating). The model uses checkmarks and simpler formatting.
7. **Comprehensive Explanation**: The golden standard provides 6 detailed justifications for each design decision. The model provides a shorter ""Why this works"" section.

## Quality Assessment

