The task requires three distinct deliverables:
1. **ANALYSE** (Step 1): Brief analysis of why the case study fails as email, naming missing elements explicitly
2. **TRANSFORMATION** (Step 2): Create optimized newsletter with specific components (Subject Line A/B variants, Preview Text, Email Body 200-300 words, PS)
