### Evaluation Against Golden Standard

**ANALYSE Section:**
- **Model Response**: Provides a clear analysis with 5 missing elements (Hook, Storytelling, Subject Line, CTA-Focus, Micro-Interaction). Uses appropriate terminology. Concise (not exceeding 2-3 sentences per point).
