**TRANSFORMATION Section:**

*Subject Line:*
- **Model Response**: Provides two A/B variants with character counts. Variant A uses personalization ({{FirstName}}) and includes a number (€340.000) but avoids the ""+47%"" spoiler. Variant B is problem-focused.
