- ✅ Subheadline: Clear, addresses target audience (Team-Leads), explains how product delivers on headline promise
- ✅ CTA: ""Kostenlos testen – 14 Tage ohne Risiko"" (action-oriented, includes Risk Reversal)
- ✅ Social Proof/Trust: SOC 2 Type II + 99.9% Uptime + implicit social proof mention
