The model response addresses all three requirements. It provides a structured chain-of-thought analysis, identifies a root cause (over-fetching of data), and proposes concrete solutions.

### Comparison with Golden Standard

**Strengths of the Model Response:**
- Clear, logical structure with step-by-step analysis
- Correctly identifies the key contradiction: 20ms API response vs. 5-10s user wait
