3. **Pedagogical Value:** The golden standard includes explicit reasoning about *why* this type of analysis is valuable (""Falsches Constraint aufdecken ist die eigentliche Aufgabe"" - identifying false constraints is the actual task). The model doesn't articulate this meta-level insight.
