- Clear, logical structure
- Accurate technical content
- Good use of chain-of-thought reasoning
- Practical recommendations

**Weaknesses:**
- Less visual/illustrative than the golden standard
- Fewer concrete examples
- Less comprehensive tool guidance
- Doesn't discuss secondary risks (livelock)
- Doesn't provide implementation guidance

