| Realistic timing | ✓ | ✓ | Both meet |
| Conversational tone | ✓ | ✓ | Both meet |
| Short sentences | ✓ | ✓ | Both meet |
| Direct address | ✓ | ✓ | Both meet |
| Screen-Annotations | ✓ | ✓✓ | GS more detailed |
| Hook in first 5s | ✓ | ✓✓ | GS more emotional |
| Pattern-Interrupt at 1:30 | ✓ | ✓✓ | GS more effective |
| Retention-Hooks | ✓ | ✓✓ | GS more integrated |
