| 400–600 words | ✓ (450–500) | ✓ (600–700) | Model slightly under |
| Easter Egg | ✓ | ✓✓ | GS more integrated |
| ""Why"" explanations | ✓ (basic) | ✓✓ (deep) | GS more thorough |

**Verdict:** Model meets ~90% of requirements adequately. Golden Standard meets 100% with superior execution on engagement elements.

---

### 6. **Critical Gaps in Model Response**

1. **Analysis lacks impact-focused reasoning** – Names problems but doesn't explain consequences.
