The response would be suitable for a quick security audit but insufficient for a comprehensive penetration test report. The missing vulnerabilities (Session Fixation, Mail Header Injection, Token Expiration) are not trivial – they represent real attack vectors.",17891.449333983473,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,4,4,3,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,False,8192,STOP,False,21.58
