|-----------|-------|-----------------|
| Analysis compactness | ✅ Meets constraint | ❌ Violates constraint |
| Optimization table quality | ✅ Good | ✅ Excellent |
| Medical safety depth | ⚠️ Partial | ✅ Comprehensive |
