3. **Legal/compliance considerations:** The model mentions ""Vertrauen"" and ""seriös"" but doesn't reference specific legal frameworks (e.g., § 312j BGB for e-commerce, WCAG for accessibility, Material Design/Apple HIG for destructive actions). The golden standard explicitly cites these.

