- Generally accurate and implementable
- Some fixes are concise but complete

**Golden Standard:**
- More detailed code examples
- Better explanation of *why* the fix works
- Includes configuration examples (e.g., GRANT statements for database users)
- More comprehensive guidance on environment variables and best practices

