### 1. ANALYSE SECTION (Step 1)

**Model Response:**
- Provides a single paragraph identifying missing elements: Hook, Timing-Marker, Spoken-Word-Phrasen, Visuals, Audio-Cues, Pausen, Production-Anweisungen, Pattern-Interrupts, Easter Eggs.
