- Provides B-roll context: [B-ROLL: Jemand speichert Datei auf USB-Stick] (not just a generic image).
- **Coverage:** ~95% of visual cues with production-level specificity.

**Verdict:** Golden standard provides more granular, production-ready visual direction.

---

#### E. Production Cues (Music, B-Roll, Jump Cuts)

**Model Response:**
- Includes: [MUSIC: Upbeat Intro], [JUMP CUT], [B-ROLL: Backup Code Image].
- Music cues are minimal (intro and fade-out only).
- B-roll is mentioned but not contextually integrated.
