- Jump cuts are purposeful: [JUMP CUT — Host direkt in die Kamera, energisch].
- Includes sound design: [CLICK: Mausklick-Sound-Animation], [MUSIC: Kurzer ""sting"" Sound-Effekt].
- **Coverage:** ~90% of production cues with functional justification.

**Verdict:** Golden standard integrates production cues as narrative tools, not just technical markers.

---

#### F. Engagement Elements (Hook, Pattern Interrupt, Retention Hooks, CTA)

**Model Response:**
- **Hook:** ""Fühlst du dich unsicher online?"" (weak, direct pitch).
- **Pattern Interrupt:** ""But wait... Du brauchst nicht zu zaudern!"" at [01:21] (present but underdeveloped).
- **Retention Hooks:** ""Coming up next..."" is absent; only ""Tada – du bist fast fertig!"" at [02:20].
- **CTA:** ""Wenn dir dieses Video geholfen hat, gib uns einen Like und abonniere den Kanal"" (standard, generic).
