## Key Differences

1. **""Fachkraft"" vs. ""Persönlichkeit""**: The golden standard uses ""Fachkraft"" (specialist/skilled worker), which is more specific and professional. The model uses ""Persönlichkeit"" (personality), which is vaguer and less directly tied to job competence.

