The model would work as a Berlin agency intro, but the golden standard would work *better* because it has stronger stylistic conviction and Berlin-specific linguistic markers.",10696.796708041802,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,4,3,3,100/100,100/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,False,25000,stop,False,149.99
