- Visual hierarchy with emoji/icons
- Implementation roadmap
- Before/after scoring
- ROI-focused prioritization

## Overall Assessment

The model response is **good but incomplete**. It successfully identifies and explains most problems with concrete solutions, but lacks the strategic framing, quantification, and roadmap that would make it truly excellent. It reads more like a detailed technical review than a comprehensive documentation audit with implementation guidance.

