| Audience segmentation | ✅ Quick nav table | ✅ Quick nav table | Tie |
| Problem list compactness | ❌ Too verbose | ✅ Compact tables | Golden |
| Explicit problem count | ❌ Missing | ✅ ""18 Probleme identifiziert"" | Golden |
| Meta-level justifications | ❌ Missing | ✅ 8 Begründungen | Golden |
| Contributor attribution | ❌ Not addressed | ✅ Identified as problem | Golden |

