| Health App | ""Auswertung ansehen"" (concrete outcome) | ""Erhalte Unterstützung"" | Less specific about what happens next |
| Banking | ""Überweisung bestätigen"" (control signal) | ""Überweisen 5.000 €"" | Weaker control/security signal |
| Game | ""Nochmal versuchen"" (Endowment Effect) | ""Hol dir Extra-Leben"" | Less psychologically grounded |

