- Easter Egg included
- Minor deviations: timing is slightly short (3:55 vs. 5:00 target), some sentences exceed 12 words
- Score: 4 (meets most requirements with minor deviations)

**Overall Score: 4/5 (Good)**

The model delivers a solid, production-ready video script that meets the core requirements. It exceeds the golden standard in some areas (troubleshooting depth, app specificity) but falls short in emotional design and narrative structure. For a professional YouTube tutorial, this would be a strong B+ effort—functional and complete, but lacking the storytelling sophistication that transforms a tutorial into a memorable experience.",31369.449167046696,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,3,4,4,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,False,25000,stop,False,15.67
