### Critical Gaps vs. Golden Standard:

1. **Missing Issues (7 not identified)**:
   - #3: Semantic markup for strikethrough price (`<del>` vs `<s>`)
   - #11: Badge accessibility (role=""note"" or integration into heading)
   - #12: Emoji accessibility (aria-hidden + sr-only pattern)
   - #15: Language of parts (English ""4 stars"" in German UI)
   - #16: Button type attribute missing
   - #19: Target size (2.5.8 — new in WCAG 2.2)
   - #20: Focus not obscured (2.4.11 — new in WCAG 2.2)

2. **Incomplete Issue Coverage**:
