5. **Depth of Analysis**:
   - Golden standard explains **why** each issue matters (e.g., ""Screen-Reader lesen nur die Zahl ohne Kontext"")
   - Golden standard provides context for subtle issues (e.g., Emoji pronunciation variance)
   - Model is more surface-level

6. **Prioritization**:
   - Model uses 4 levels (Kritisch/Hoch/Mittel/Niedrig)
   - Golden standard uses a matrix with clear action items and testing checklist
