- Demonstrates self-correction and verification
- Provides linguistic analysis explaining why ""all but 9"" directly means 9 survive
- Includes pedagogical depth about why this is a trick question
- Explains the distractor role of the number 17
- Offers verification through logical reversal

The model response:
